# Graphify knowledge graph (generated, including the wiki — regenerable from code via `make wiki-refresh`).
# Kept local-only so the ~130-file wiki refresh after every code change never pollutes git history.
# A fresh clone rebuilds it with one `/wiki` run.
graphify-out/

